01:59:51.135 --> 01:59:53.985
But she doesn't actually work for the UN?

01:59:53.985 --> 01:59:55.665
She's like a contractor?

01:59:55.665 --> 01:59:57.215
It's complicated.

01:59:57.215 --> 02:00:00.075
There's all these special repertoires of the UN

02:00:00.075 --> 02:00:01.465
of their different committees that are able

02:00:01.465 --> 02:00:06.385
to launch investigations that the UN will either provide

02:00:06.385 --> 02:00:09.405
a budget for and then ultimately let them speak.

02:00:09.405 --> 02:00:14.405
So Agnes does an entire investigation

02:00:14.425 --> 02:00:18.125
of the Khashoggi murder, presents her finding

02:00:18.125 --> 02:00:23.125
to the United Nations Human Rights Council,

02:00:23.185 --> 02:00:26.405
but the Human Rights Council is kinda like WADA,

02:00:26.405 --> 02:00:28.185
they're just there to observe and report,

02:00:28.185 --> 02:00:30.722
they have no power, right?

02:00:30.722 --> 02:00:33.105
And the United States under Trump actually

