has a seat on the United Nations Human Rights Council.

02:00:45.695 --> 02:00:48.618
How is that possible?
How is that possible?

02:00:50.035 --> 02:00:51.998
Trump pulled us out of the...

02:00:53.645 --> 02:00:55.622
We're no longer part of the United Nations-

02:00:55.622 --> 02:00:59.100
That's outrageous.
Human Rights Council

02:00:59.100 --> 02:01:02.418
Unbelievable, but Saudi Arabia is.

02:01:03.439 --> 02:01:06.252
(Bryan and Rich laugh)

02:01:06.252 --> 02:01:09.715
So Agnes presents her finding to the Khashoggi murder,

02:01:09.715 --> 02:01:13.385
as you see in the film, to the United Nations

02:01:13.385 --> 02:01:16.915
Human Rights Committee, but, like WADA, the only thing

