02:01:25.215 --> 02:01:30.215
to do something about it, and so the Human Rights Committee

02:01:31.465 --> 02:01:32.615
doesn't have the power.

02:01:34.373 --> 02:01:39.015
And ultimately, despite the evidence, despite the report,

02:01:39.015 --> 02:01:41.505
despite the intelligence in the CIA

02:01:41.505 --> 02:01:43.885
and British intelligence, and the transcript

02:01:43.885 --> 02:01:45.865
