02:01:45.865 --> 02:01:50.685
the United Nations General Assembly, the Security Council,

02:01:50.685 --> 02:01:52.839
has not taken up this investigation

02:01:52.839 --> 02:01:56.795
and has not sanctioned Saudi Arabia, and has done nothing

02:01:56.795 --> 02:01:59.795
to take action against Saudi Arabia, and not only that,

02:01:59.795 --> 02:02:04.102
you saw the G20 just hosted, just weeks ago,

02:02:06.625 --> 02:02:10.988
a week ago in Riyadh.

