in the middle of that, and there's no penalty for that,

02:02:28.105 --> 02:02:30.178
or any kind of repercussions.

02:02:31.669 --> 02:02:35.455
It was startling, and I think again, so we were allowed,

02:02:35.455 --> 02:02:40.455
which is kind of unheard of, to have film cameras

02:02:42.245 --> 02:02:44.855
within the United Nations, let alone

02:02:45.975 --> 02:02:48.775
in an official United Nations

02:02:48.775 --> 02:02:52.805
Human Rights Committee meeting.

02:02:52.805 --> 02:02:57.295
But we were connected through Agnes, and we got in touch

02:02:57.295 --> 02:03:00.655
