02:03:04.315 --> 02:03:07.045
And so we were granted a very special permission

02:03:07.045 --> 02:03:12.045
to go in there with our cameras, to film Agnes' testimony,

02:03:13.425 --> 02:03:15.475
and Hatice speaking in front

02:03:15.475 --> 02:03:19.745
of the United Nations Human Rights Committee,

02:03:19.745 --> 02:03:24.695
