on this matter, literally, get up and walked out the door.

02:03:34.925 --> 02:03:36.218
So that did happen-

02:03:36.218 --> 02:03:37.095
That did happen-

02:03:37.095 --> 02:03:38.035
At that time 'cause when I was watching

02:03:38.035 --> 02:03:39.885
I was like, I was wondering, I was like,

