at the end?

02:03:45.435 --> 02:03:46.665
No.
Wow.

02:03:46.665 --> 02:03:50.145
That happened in real time.

02:03:50.145 --> 02:03:55.145
It was unbelievable, literally, watching the Saudis

02:03:55.995 --> 02:03:58.705
not only deny any responsibility,

02:03:58.705 --> 02:04:02.745
say that this is a Saudi matter, but then Hatice

02:04:02.745 --> 02:04:06.985
goes to give her two minutes, I can't remember,

02:04:06.985 --> 02:04:11.985
three minutes of asking for justice, and as she goes

02:04:12.035 --> 02:04:15.465
to speak, the two Saudi representatives

02:04:15.465 --> 02:04:17.318
get up and walk out the door.

02:04:19.005 --> 02:04:21.225
It's insane.
Insane.

02:04:21.225 --> 02:04:22.275
Wow.

02:04:22.275 --> 02:04:25.395
