The evidence is, when you look at what he brought forward,

02:05:33.883 --> 02:05:37.275
there's no denying, it is what it is,

02:05:37.275 --> 02:05:41.095
and all the investigation surrounded, it proved it.

02:05:41.095 --> 02:05:44.755
So in this case of the Khashoggi murder, right,

