this in the US courts, and there's all

02:36:50.205 --> 02:36:53.105
these logistics around it, but basically,

02:36:53.105 --> 02:36:55.965
it makes it that if an athlete comes the United States

02:36:55.965 --> 02:36:58.985
and if there's others, but Rodchenkov Anti-Doping Act

02:36:58.985 --> 02:37:03.665
just passed and Russia is still banned

02:37:03.665 --> 02:37:07.175
from global sport, and so it's lived on,

02:37:07.175 --> 02:37:12.175
and so I think, for me, it's really looking at stories

02:37:12.315 --> 02:37:16.565
that I think that I can tell, that can possibly

02:37:16.565 --> 02:37:21.565
have a global impact, that can have resonance behind it

02:37:23.245 --> 02:37:25.485
and live on I'm hoping that "The Dissident"

02:37:25.485 --> 02:37:28.135
and the story behind the murder of Jamal Khashoggi

02:37:29.555 --> 02:37:34.415
will be that, and certainly in other subject matter

02:37:34.415 --> 02:37:37.522
that I'm looking at, and I think that the hard thing

02:37:37.522 --> 02:37:42.522
and the question kinda becomes, what is that future

02:37:43.485 --> 02:37:47.945
in having material like this distributed,

02:37:47.945 --> 02:37:51.495
because it is becoming more and more difficult.

02:37:51.495 --> 02:37:55.075
And, this, for example, and we talked about this,

02:37:55.075 --> 02:37:58.005
