02:38:13.275 --> 02:38:18.275
And so, when you have this level of fear going on

02:38:18.985 --> 02:38:22.835
that is perpetuating societies, the question

02:38:22.835 --> 02:38:27.835
is what is that next story, and will that next story be able

02:38:28.435 --> 02:38:30.675
