02:38:30.675 --> 02:38:33.525
And that kind of leads into the whole,

02:38:33.525 --> 02:38:37.515
whether it's the false narratives going on

02:38:37.515 --> 02:38:41.805
around election fraud, or it's the false narratives

02:38:41.805 --> 02:38:46.805
that get put out of Russia, or Saudi or anything else?

02:38:46.975 --> 02:38:50.125
I think it's becoming harder and harder

02:38:50.125 --> 02:38:54.053
to just have something just go, the truth is the truth,

02:38:54.053 --> 02:38:55.745
is the truth.

02:38:55.745 --> 02:38:59.155
And we used to go, you'd pick up a New York Times

02:38:59.155 --> 02:39:01.145
and go, okay, it's the New York Times,

02:39:01.145 --> 02:39:02.635
it's the truth, right?

02:39:02.635 --> 02:39:07.155
And now, you even have 50% of the country going,

02:39:07.155 --> 02:39:08.815
the New York Times is not the truth,

02:39:08.815 --> 02:39:11.835
the New York Times is fake news.

02:39:11.835 --> 02:39:16.225
And you go, okay, how does this come to a place

02:39:16.225 --> 02:39:20.505
where this stops, where the news becomes the news again,

02:39:20.505 --> 02:39:24.245
truth becomes truth, again, facts become facts again,

02:39:24.245 --> 02:39:25.899
and I don't have those answers-

02:39:25.899 --> 02:39:27.645
Yeah, I mean finding our way back to that

02:39:27.645 --> 02:39:30.535
is very difficult, and the irony being, of course,

02:39:30.535 --> 02:39:33.965
that we've never had greater immediate access

02:39:33.965 --> 02:39:37.085
to more information, and yet, our level of trust

02:39:37.085 --> 02:39:39.565
